## Which Screen or Projector Fits Your Room

A 2x2m screen with a 3000-lumen projector, on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), suits a smaller meeting room up to 40 guests. A 60 inch LED display, on the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), suits a larger conference room without a projector throw-distance to plan around, up to 120 guests. For a brighter or larger room, the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/)'s 5000-lumen laser projector stays legible even in a lit room, which is why it is also our pick for a product launch or dealership showcase.

## Connecting Your Own Laptop

Our [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes HDMI and USB-C adapters plus audio interfaces to connect your own laptop, tablet or media player to our screen and sound system.

## Costa del Sol Coverage, Not Just Malaga City

Malaga Event Gear's delivery route is not limited to the city center: our crew reaches Marbella, Fuengirola, Torremolinos, Benalmadena, Estepona, Mijas, Nerja, Antequera, Ronda, Coin and Velez-Malaga on a standard booking, with Sevilla and Granada available for larger events. Whichever Costa del Sol town your projector, screen or LED display needs to reach, we deliver, install and test it on site.

