## FAQs

### What is the difference between audio visual hire near me and audio video rental near me?

They cover different parts of our catalog. [Audio visual hire near me](/blog/audio-visual-hire-near-me-in-malaga-spain/) covers our general sound and lighting packages for weddings and parties. This page covers the screen and projector side of our catalog, for presentations, conferences and product launches.

### What size screen or projector do I need?

For a smaller meeting room up to 40 guests, the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/)'s 2x2m screen and 3000-lumen projector work well. For a larger conference room up to 120 guests, the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/)'s 60 inch LED display avoids a long projector throw distance. See [Which Screen or Projector Fits Your Room](#which-screen-or-projector-fits-your-room) above.

### Can I connect my own laptop to the projector or screen?

Yes. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes HDMI and USB-C adapters plus audio interfaces to connect your laptop, tablet or media player.

### Is a technician included?

Not on the Product Presentation Pack or Basic MICE Pack: the equipment is delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then run by you. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) includes a technician on site for up to six hours.

### How much does audio video rental cost near me?

Pricing depends on the package: our full catalog, from the Basic MICE Pack up to the MICE Pack for a larger conference, is listed with exact euro pricing on our [packages page](/packages/). All rates are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown.

### Do you deliver audio video rental outside Malaga city?

Yes. Our delivery area covers the wider Costa del Sol, not just Malaga city: Marbella, Fuengirola, Torremolinos, Benalmadena, Estepona, Mijas, Nerja and Antequera are all in range, with Sevilla and Granada available for larger bookings. See [Costa del Sol Coverage, Not Just Malaga City](#costa-del-sol-coverage-not-just-malaga-city) above.

### How far in advance should I book audio video rental?

Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.
